      "writtenOn": "2020-04-04T15:45:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tethering only choose 24 prefix length, so I would like to keep original simpler code and raise IllegalArgumentException to warning if we got unexpected prefix length here.\n\nBTW, there is a problem for suggested code that the return address may not match prefix because of DOUG_ADAMS replacement.\ne.g prefix 192.168.0.255/25 would get InetAddress 192.168.0.42 that 192.168.0.42 is not in 192.168.0.255/25 prefix.",
